{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13218290","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13218290","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1321829001:1":{"text":"柳博米尔来过？他找你有什么事情？","source_cn":"柳博米尔来过？他找你有什么事情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35E7ED2337E364DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321829002:1":{"text":"那个哥哥清晨很早就来了。他给了我一束花，让我放在我爸爸妈妈的墓前……还说了一些我不是很明白的话。","source_cn":"那个哥哥清晨很早就来了。他给了我一束花，让我放在我爸爸...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x910AF7642E10670C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321829003:1":{"text":"他说了什么？","source_cn":"他说了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD90F1309A6A9F2D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321829004:1":{"text":"让我想想……他说了生命脆弱什么的……哦，对了，还说了永寂花……还有，还有……","source_cn":"让我想想……他说了生命脆弱什么的……哦，对了，还说了永...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00B7E685835BECE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321829005:2":{"text":"你父母的葬礼是今天，对吧？","source_cn":"你父母的葬礼是今天，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3D946590ECCF885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":